flowchart TD
    KAFKA["Kafka<br/>github_raw_events<br/>16 partitions"]
    READ["Spark readStream<br/>parse JSON schema<br/>watermark 10 phút"]
    KAFKA -->|"consume"| READ

    subgraph SINKS["Hai luồng ghi độc lập"]
        direction LR
        PQ["Parquet Sink<br/>append mode<br/>event_date=2026-01-01/<br/>event_type=WatchEvent/<br/>*.parquet"]
        CH["ClickHouse Sink<br/>foreachBatch<br/>INSERT chunk 1000 rows<br/>github_data (MergeTree)"]
    end

    READ --> PQ
    READ --> CH

    BATCH["Spark Batch Job<br/>nightly 02:00 UTC<br/>Parquet → repo_star_counts<br/>Parquet → repo_activity_summary"]
    PQ -->|"cold read"| BATCH
    BATCH --> CH
